        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY***\n\nProperty Partners Gill & Glynn are pleased to bring to the rental market this well presented two bedroom semi-detached home, offering bright and comfortable accommodation throughout.\n\n\nThe ground floor comprises a fitted kitchen with a range of storage units and appliances, leading through to a spacious open plan living and dining area. \n\n\nUpstairs, the accommodation comprises two bedrooms. The main bedroom is a generous double room, while the second bedroom is fitted with a double bunk bed and built in storage. \nA fully tiled main bathroom with bath and electric shower completes the accommodation.\n\n\nThe property benefits from electric heating, timber flooring through much of the living and bedroom accommodation, and is offered furnished."
